is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_agriculture.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'agriculture_development') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.agriculture_development (technical reference 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.9). Opening and closing
// the card are free; a confirmed option costs this month's action, or the one free step of an adviser
// who opened the card. Options that need a system of a later stage are shown with their reason.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'agriculture_development');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_agriculture');
!}

= Modernisation of agriculture

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

Each project covers one of three tranches of the countryside and costs 1 B for 4 months, nothing after. The same area does not get the same improvement twice; land reform and modernisation may cover the same people.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @advisory
- @consolidation
- @cooperative_processing_sales
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@advisory
title: Advice, tools and cooperative modernisation
subtitle: Agrarian pressure falls (−2); better conditions of the farms covered.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'agriculture_development', 'advisory').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_agriculture_development_advisory_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'agriculture_development', 'advisory');
!}
go-to: result

@consolidation
title: Voluntary consolidation of land
subtitle: Agrarian pressure falls (−2); needs its law; a dispute over borders halts it.
